  ],
  "adaptation": "othersOff only; automatically follow the current native hand layout (no extra manual-sort flag), >=15 active cards per hand zone. Existing other-style count>=15 behavior retained. Independent hidden-by-default tag avoids the companion card-face hiding native .name; CSS only reveals it under the current hand zone. Dimensions map 126x174 to existing 108x150 cards and inherit cardScale. Use official short names for base cards and translated name fallback for extension cards; no gameplay change.",
